= Eclipse Graphical Editing Framework documentation =

This help plug-in demonstrates how Eclipse help can be generated from MediaWiki markup with Mylyn WikiText.

The source is stored in this repository so that builds are reproducible and do not depend on the retired Eclipsepedia MediaWiki API.

== Current resources ==

* [https://eclipse.dev/gef/ Eclipse GEF documentation]
* [https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/tools.gef Eclipse GEF project page]
* [https://wiki.eclipse.org/Category:GEF Archived Eclipsepedia GEF category]

== Building the sample ==

Run the Maven build from the repository root. The generated HTML and table of contents are packaged as an Eclipse help plug-in.

<pre>
mvn -B --no-transfer-progress verify --file wikitext-sample/pom.xml
</pre>

== Installing the result ==

Copy the generated plug-in JAR from the Maven target directory into the Eclipse dropins directory, restart Eclipse, and open Help > Help Contents > Graphical Editing Framework.
